  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 2621 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D10"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the methotrexate sodium injection shortage on 2023-03-13 and it remains Current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E34", "E29", "E30", "E31", "E32", "E33"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The shortage has been on FDA's list for 43 months.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An FDA inspection of Elite Laboratories Inc. (FEI 3002644678) ended 2016-02-02 and was classified OAI.",
      "cites": ["E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification was 2621 days before the shortage posting on 2023-03-13.",
      "cites": ["D10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later inspection of the same plant ended 2020-03-13 and was classified VAI, 1095 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["D10", "E18"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Zydus Lifesciences Limited (FEI 3007938603) had a VAI inspection ending 2023-03-24, 11 days after the posting.",
      "cites": ["D11", "E27"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑based best option is to buy from Alembic Pharmaceuticals Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D13"]
    }
  ]
}
